<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 1.3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 1.3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it bought back a further 1.3 million shares on Monday between NZ$6.54 and $6.55 as part of its continuing $1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>The stock closed five cents higher at $6.55 on volume of 3.9 million shares. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
